<title>GERMANY: Siemens share of rail contract 320 mln DM.</title>
<headline>Siemens share of rail contract 320 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siemens AG said on Tuesday it was awarded 320 million marks of a 380 million mark contract announced earlier by Deutsche Bahn AG.</p>
<p>The Siemens-led consortium, which will provide electrical equipment for a high-speed rail line between Cologne and Frankfurt, also includes ABB, Elpro and Deutsche Bahn's own construction unit.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
